{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_05519","headline":"奉和扈从温泉宫承恩赐浴 · 蔡希周","name":"奉和扈从温泉宫承恩赐浴","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"天行云从指骊宫，浴日余波锡诏同。\n彩殿氤氲拥香溜，纱窗宛转闭和风。\n来将兰气冲皇泽，去引星文捧碧空。\n自怜遇坎便能止，愿托仙槎路未通。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"蔡希周","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_05519.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_05519","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}